  "extract": "The 17th Field Artillery Brigade, \"America's Premier HIMARS Brigade\", is an artillery brigade in the United States Army. It is currently based in Joint Base Lewis McChord Washington as Force Fires Headquarters for I Corps.",
  "extract_html": "<p>The <b>17th Field Artillery Brigade</b>, \"America's Premier HIMARS Brigade\", is an artillery brigade in the United States Army. It is currently based in Joint Base Lewis McChord Washington as Force Fires Headquarters for I Corps.</p>"
